## 5. Cloud CI/CD Alignment

The local DevOps Shield is completely mirrored in our cloud infrastructure (GitHub Actions).

* **`ci.yml`:** The continuous integration pipeline spins up a fully functional matrix (MongoDB, PostgreSQL, Redis) and runs the exact same `make lint` and `make typecheck` commands before executing Unit and E2E tests.
* **Redundancy:** If a developer forces a bad commit locally using `git commit --no-verify`, the Cloud CI acts as the ultimate judge and will block the Pull Request merge.

Additionally, asynchronous automation bots (`pr-watchdog.yml`, `stale.yml`, `weekly-summary.yml`) are deployed to manage team workflow and issue triage without manual intervention.

